1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:02,580
Gumagana ba ang
solar panels sa gabi?

2
00:00:02,930 --> 00:00:05,800
Hello, SoSmart viewers!
Kuya SoLight 'to!

3
00:00:06,150 --> 00:00:10,300
Hindi. Kailangan ng liwanag
para gumawa ng kuryente.

4
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:12,430
Kung solar ang
gamit mo sa gabi,

5
00:00:12,480 --> 00:00:16,140
galing 'yan sa battery
na nag-charge noong araw.

6
00:00:16,440 --> 00:00:20,830
Kapag wala o ubos na ang
battery, grid na ang kukunan.

7
00:00:21,130 --> 00:00:24,320
Magkaiba ang solar
generation at stored energy.

8
00:00:24,720 --> 00:00:30,608
Dahil ang gusto ni Kuya SoLight…
naka-solar ka na, SoSmart ka pa!

9
00:00:30,958 --> 00:00:33,138
Life is SoLight with Solar.
